(before the scheme check that currently lets `action:` leak to the browser), add:
   ```
   if (href.startsWith('action:')) {
   	event.preventDefault();
   	if (href === 'action:list') { w_operation.set(T_Operation.list); onclose(); }
   	return;
   }
   ```

That closes help and switches to the list when the link is clicked. (Add more `if (href === 'action:…')` lines for other actions later.)

